algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: A ∈ ℝ^{n×n}, x ∈ ℝ^n
Output: T_A(x) ∈ ℝ^n

for i = 0 to n-1:
    T_A(x)[i] = min_{j=0}^{n-1} (A[i,j] + x[j])
return T_A(x)

Complexity: O(n²)

Input: A ∈ ℝ^{n×n}
Output: (i₀, j₀) or None

row_mins ← [min_j A[i,j] for each i]
col_maxs ← [max_i A[i,j] for each j]

for i = 0 to n-1:
    for j = 0 to n-1:
        if A[i,j] == row_mins[i] and A[i,j] == col_maxs[j]:
            return (i, j)
return None

Complexity: O(n²)
